B.a9I=new A.Y("Create a Template Prompt for Turning Notes Into Emails","You often write emails based on meeting notes or rough drafts. You want a reusable template prompt that reliably turns your notes into a short, professional email.","Create a reusable email-writing prompt that turns rough notes into a short, professional email. Include placeholders for greeting, purpose, key details, and next steps. Keep it to two or three short paragraphs.","**Reusable Email Prompt**\nTurn the notes below into a short, professional email in two or three brief paragraphs.\nInclude:\n- A clear greeting\n- A short introduction explaining the purpose\n- The key details from the notes\n- Any next steps or actions\n- A polite closing\n\nNotes: [paste notes here]","Reusable email prompts work best when your instructions define the exact building blocks.","When you tell AI the structure and list the components it must include, you create a prompt you can reuse across different situations.",B.aeM,B.Mv)
